gantt
    title Working days only
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    excludes weekends, 2024-05-01
    tickInterval 1week
    axisFormat %e %b
    section Sprint 1
    Planning     : p1, 2024-04-29, 2d
    Implementation (долгая задача с длинным названием) : i1, after p1, 6d
    section Sprint 2
    Testing      : t1, after i1, 4d
    Deploy       :milestone, after t1, 0d
